        {
          "title": "",
          "body": "The Ceramics Apse is Arcosanti's hub for hand-carved ceramic tiles, their designs drawn from the surrounding landscape and architecture. During FORM, it doubles as an intimate performance venue showcasing Spotify’s Fresh Finds artists, its curved concrete shell wrapping sound around the crowd."
        }
