      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "",
          "body": "Two grand structures with textured surfaces, constructed from concrete poured over shaped earth and adorned with colorful rubber stencils, The Vaults are designed for shade, airflow, and gathering. Home to yoga, meditation, activities and music performances throughout the weekend, The Vaults are cool and breezy by morning and fully immersive after dark."
        }
